WEBVTT

00:08:58.284 --> 00:09:03.581
as a leader, is that you need
to make conscious, coherent,

00:09:03.622 --> 00:09:06.500
authentic choices

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.796
about what you will make a stand on
and what you won't.

00:09:11.672 --> 00:09:14.842
And do that in conjunction
with your stakeholders and, of course,

00:09:14.842 --> 00:09:17.803
your employees are one
of your key stakeholders there.

00:09:19.722 --> 00:09:23.892
Final point is that it's
useful to understand

00:09:23.934 --> 00:09:28.606
what your employees think your
response has been

00:09:28.606 --> 00:09:31.275
to activist issues so far.